Grant an acs flag to an account.

usage: @grant <account> <flag>

Sets a single access-control flag on an account. The change is stored on
the account and lasts across logins. A flag is one letter or digit. The
'w' flag marks an account as wizard-capable.

Wizard only. Use @revoke to clear a flag.

Example:
  @grant alice w    Make the account 'alice' wizard-capable.
